\ Canonical explicit-bound formulation for WL comparison.
\ Finite bounds and singleton restrictions merged; original variable domains retained.
Maximize
  obj: + 60.799999999999997 x_1 + 918.45000000000005 x_2 + 77.519999999999996 x_3
Subject To
  __wl_bound_00001_lower: + 1 x_1 >= 0
  __wl_bound_00001_upper: + 1 x_1 <= 678906
  __wl_bound_00002_lower: + 1 x_2 >= 0
  __wl_bound_00002_upper: + 1 x_2 <= 749927
  __wl_bound_00003_lower: + 1 x_3 >= 0
  __wl_bound_00003_upper: + 1 x_3 <= 699808
Bounds
  x_1 free
  x_2 free
  x_3 free
Generals
  x_1 x_2 x_3
End
